Utter a terrible curse against any who dare approach you, inflicting [197, 265, 318, 363, 403 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage to targets in radius 3. Each affected target (ordered at random) takes [32%, 25%, 22%, 19%, 17% (TL1-5)] less damage than the last, and has a 25% chance of suffering Brainlock.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
